      "search:title": "Human Influenza A(H1N1)pdm09 virus, A/Athens.GR/21/2025(H1N1)pdm09 virus, Η275Υ mutation",
      "search:description": "Antiviral resistant human influenza A(H1N1)pdm09 virus isolated in 2024/2025 season in Greece, antiviral resistant wit Η275Υ mutation. The viral isolate can be shipped in dry ice or freeze dried. Infectious cell culture supernatant preserved in Viral Storage Medium -80°C. To confirm its identity the hemagglutinin and neuraminidase genes have been sequenced by sanger sequencing method and confirmed with WGS.",
