      "dcterms:description": "Human influenza A(H3N2) isolated in 2025/2026 season in Greece. The viral isolate can be shipped in dry ice or freeze dried. Infectious cell culture supernatant preserved in Viral Storage Medium -80°C. To confirm its identity the hemagglutinin and neuraminidase genes have been sequenced by sanger sequencing method and confirmed by WGS.",
