      "search:title": "Sandfly Fever Naples Virus (strain Yu_SP67/BF)",
      "search:description": "The virus was isolated from a sandfly homogenate sample SP67/BF collected in Kosovo. The product is an infectious cell culture supernatant. The Sandfly Fever Naples virus (strain Yu) is preserved in Viral Storage Medium at -80°C. The virus is confirmed to be free of mycoplasma. Its identity was confirmed by sequencing.",
