      "dcterms:title": "Encapsidated RNA corresponding to the phleboviruses sequence amplified by specific P&amp;P (ref: 001K-06215)   ",
      "dcterms:description": "The lyophilized, non infectious, encapsidated RNA (Armored RNA) contains the sequence of L-segment region from phleboviruses and can be used as positive control for extraction and real time RT-PCR using specific Primers and probe ref: 001K-06215\r\nExtraction is mandatory before use in real time RT-PCR. \r\nPackaged for 100 Rxns, for RUO (Research Use Only). \r\nSOPs in the attached pdf.",
