      "dcterms:modified": "2024-08-22T11:50:04+02:00",
      "dcterms:title": "Positive control for Monkeypox virus and Orthopoxviruses DNA (synthetic target-specific DNA)",
      "dcterms:description": "Target-specific synthetic DNA  of Monkeypox virus (real time PCR targeting region of the F3L gene) and Orthopoxviruses DNA detection (real time PCR targeting region of the OPE9L gene) for 100 Rxns.\r\nProvided as lyophilized DNA material ready to use after resuspension. \r\nNote: This positive control must be used with specific Primers and Probe for Monkeypox detection (ref: 001K-04710) and Orthopoxviruses detection (ref: 001K-04711)\r\nReference article : Kulesh D.A. et al. 2003:Smallpox and pan-Orthopox Virus Detection by Real-Time 3-Minor Groove Binder TaqMan Assays on the Roche LightCycler and the Cepheid Smart Cycler Platforms.\r\nSOPs in the attached pdf. \r\nFor RUO (Research Use Only).",
