      "EVORAO:preparationTechnique": "solid phase column extraction",
      "EVORAO:observedMutations": "mutations as indicated in the name; backbone is NL-NFX (pNL-NF with XmaI site behind protease):\r\nThe virus genome is derived from pNL-NF (pNL4-3 with shortened cellular flank) (doi.org/10.1016/j.jcv.2006.05.001), after introduction of a unique XmaI site 3’ (ccagga2589ccCggG; silent in Env; L->S in Rev) from the protease gene, respectively. The original BamHI site as position 8465 is retained.",
